WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:09.410
<v AI>Thanks for calling Brightside Dental. We're closed for the night, but I can book appointments and answer questions. How can I help?

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:15.360
<v Customer>Hi — I chipped a front tooth. How much is a crown, and can anyone see me this week?

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:32.570
<v AI>I'm sorry, that's never fun. From our fee schedule, a crown runs eleven hundred to sixteen hundred dollars depending on the material, and the exact figure is confirmed after an exam and X-ray. This week I have Thursday at ten thirty or Friday at eight. Which works better?

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:34.730
<v Customer>Thursday, please.

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:39.480
<v AI>Thursday at ten thirty it is. Can I get your name and a mobile number?

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:44.180
<v Customer>It's Jane Kim, five five five, zero one four seven.

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:55.410
<v AI>Thank you, Jane. You're booked for Thursday at ten thirty. I'm texting you a confirmation now, with directions and parking since it's your first visit. Is the tooth hurting right now?

00:00:56.010 --> 00:00:58.290
<v Customer>It's a little sensitive, that's all.

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:07.510
<v AI>Then avoid very cold food until Thursday, and if the pain gets worse, call this number again — I answer at night too. We'll see you Thursday.

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:09.530
<v Customer>Great, thanks.

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:12.000
<v AI>Thank you. Have a good night.

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:17.800
Customer: Hi, Jane Kim from last night — is there parking?

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:21.600
AI: Yes — four spaces behind the building. Your Thursday 10:30 booking is unchanged.

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:24.800
Customer: Will my insurance cover the crown?

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:28.600
AI: Coverage is a call for the desk, not for me. I’ve passed our conversation along — someone will reply this morning.

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:35.800
A person replies

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:42.800
The next morning’s screen
